### Soyuz UI strings (en-US source): tui-dialogs
### The terminal UI: core prompt dialogs (Phase T3: job prompts, delete, quit, transfer, new link, approvals; soyuz-tui view/dialogs + input/dialogs: prompt, delete, quit, transfer, link, approval_*).
### Keys: <area>-<thing>, kebab-case. Keep keys identical in tr-TR/tui-dialogs.ftl.


tui-dialogs-hint-prompt = Tab next · Enter choose · Esc decide later
tui-dialogs-hint-more = ↑/↓ option · Enter choose · Esc back
tui-dialogs-hint-rename = Enter rename · Esc back
tui-dialogs-hint-confirm = Enter confirm · Esc cancel
tui-dialogs-hint-quit = Enter quit when finished · Esc keep open
tui-dialogs-hint-transfer = Tab complete · ↑/↓ folder · Enter confirm · Esc cancel
tui-dialogs-hint-link = Tab next · ←/→ kind · Enter create · Esc cancel
tui-dialogs-hint-approval = ↑/↓ scroll · Enter approve · Esc reject
tui-dialogs-hint-script = ↑/↓ scroll · Enter run · Esc cancel
tui-dialogs-link-kind = Kind
tui-dialogs-mcp-conflict = conflict
